    "reason": "The release note [ev-acbc61fe8213] says only that resources marked prune=false are no longer counted in \"PruningRequired\". The changed files [ev-1d7e7a5569f1] place the fix in the v1alpha1 Application API types, but nothing says what \"PruningRequired count\" is (a status field, a condition, a UI summary or a metric). The PR description [ev-9f5e99e27a9b, ev-b4f26bca67d7] is just the template checklist plus \"Fixes #21890\", and that issue isn't shown. So nothing states what operators saw before the fix (a wrong number on screen, or an effect on sync or health status) or which environments are exposed beyond having prune=false resources. Issue #21890 or the PR diff is needed to type the subject, applicability and consequence.",
